// Vertical slice level. Hand-written in the editor's format (olvin_scene::file).
// Player starts in the south hall; a pressure plate opens the door in the
// dividing wall; the robot (a skinned glTF with an Idle/Wave graph) waits in
// the north room.
(
    version: 2,
